{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846840/extras/d6e00500adb0e806578952f3f19e1dbd.avif?t=1751622167\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WHAT IS COVENANT 21?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Covenant 21 is a card game in which, through the mechanics of Black Jack, you will have to defeat the Covenant level by level. But it won't be that easy; at each level you must meet a condition to access the next one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846840/extras/a828b6c4350a39286e47013e20113129.avif?t=1751622167\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>HOW DO I PLAY?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Place your bet, ask for a card, stand, and beat the bank to continue progressing. Don't forget that the goal is to surpass the level, but also not to go bankrupt, so bet responsibly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But don't slack off!! Keep an eye on your finances, bet wisely, and stand when the risk is too high.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846840/extras/a828b6c4350a39286e47013e20113129.avif?t=1751622167\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>POWER-UPS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you find it complicated? Don't worry, visit the store and buy Power-Ups to help you achieve your goals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846840/extras/f7eed2f8b767f67f41fc5c06fa3691c0.avif?t=1751622167\" /></div></p>","background":"https://st